    <bpmn:process id="W_W2752" name="W2752. Annual Capex Portfolio Review &amp; Process Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual strategic planning cycle (Q4)
Frequency: Annual
Volume: 1 comprehensive review
Owner: CFO
Participants: CFO, FP&amp;A, VP Store Operations, COO, CIO, CEO
Source: workflow W2752 — Annual Capex Portfolio Review &amp; Process Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2752_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2752_Lane1" name="FP&amp;A">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2752_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2752_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2752_Lane2" name="CFO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2752_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2752_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2752_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2752_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2752_Start4" name="Annual strategic planning cycle (Q4)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2752_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2752_Task5" name="FP&amp;A prepares annual capex portfolio review: (a) total capex spent vs. budget…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: FP&amp;A prepares annual capex portfolio review: (a) total capex spent vs. budget (by category: new stores, renovations, DC, IT, equipment), (b) project delivery performance: % on time, % on budget, % achieving projected ROI, (c) cost estimation accuracy: average budget variance per project type, (d) timeline estimation accuracy: average schedule variance, (e) post-implementation ROI results: actual vs. projected across completed projects, (f) abandoned project cost and reasons, (g) capital productivity: revenue growth ÷ capex invested
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2752_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2752_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2752_Task6" name="CFO and C-Suite review capex portfolio performance: (a) which project types…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CFO and C-Suite review capex portfolio performance: (a) which project types deliver best returns (new stores vs. renovations vs. IT)? (b) what systemic issues cause overruns? (c) what estimation biases need correction? (d) is capex spend aligned with strategic priorities?
Responsible (R): CFO / C-Suite
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2752_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2752_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2752_Task7" name="Process improvements identified and implemented: (a) estimation methodology…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Process improvements identified and implemented: (a) estimation methodology: adjust cost escalation factors based on actual construction inflation, (b) approval process: streamline for repeatable project types (new stores have standardized approval), (c) contractor management: update contractor qualification criteria based on performance, (d) system enhancements: automate CIP-to-asset conversion, improve cost tracking granularity per W1810
Responsible (R): CFO / COO / CIO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 1–2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2752_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2752_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2752_Task8" name="Updated capex process guidelines distributed to all project stakeholders…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Updated capex process guidelines distributed to all project stakeholders; training provided for new procedures
Responsible (R): CFO / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2752_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2752_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2752_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2752_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2752_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-363 (ensure controlled execution — Construction-in-Progress &amp; Asset Turnover (PA-40.3).) | - operational: CFO review and approval gate
Owner: CFO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
